WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,680
The three-and-a-half-knife lock is at the same height as the ground

2
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,120
The first knife was intended to give a warning

3
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,680
The second shovel leg

4
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,080
The third live button

5
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,540
Tengsuo can't stop a 200 kilogram pig

6
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:14,700
At most half a foot

7
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:17,360
What I want is this kick

8
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:29,160
This job is much more expensive than moving firewood.

9
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,920
When you divide the meat, take two more bites

10
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:34,540
The hole has been dug

11
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:35,860
But will it really fall?

12
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:37,180
Then look at it, are you stupid?

13
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,300
If you can’t fall, there’s still another move

14
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:45,630
What is that wood on the tree? It's fallen wood.

15
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:47,630
As soon as the rope is broken, it will be smashed down

16
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:50,590
Who will cut off the hand will be decided later.

17
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:53,540
Work in the camp now

18
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:54,660
I'm almost listening to you now

19
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:57,360
before life and death

20
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,280
Who is right? Who listens?

21
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:01,310
The condom has been taken off

22
00:01:01,550 --> 00:01:03,470
No one is allowed to go to the west slope these two days

23
00:01:04,530 --> 00:01:06,050
Keep an eye on the fire on the home page tonight

24
00:01:06,250 --> 00:01:07,330
Bamboo tubes are hung in three places

25
00:01:07,570 --> 00:01:08,930
Shout when you hear the noise

26
00:01:09,170 --> 00:01:10,530
Why don't you just hunt a pig in Jingshan?

27
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:11,930
It's like a military order

28
00:01:12,210 --> 00:01:13,810
Tomorrow your post will be extended to the east

29
00:01:13,810 --> 00:01:14,730
three frame stones

30
00:01:15,090 --> 00:01:16,930
Last month you were at the bottom of the rankings

31
00:01:22,220 --> 00:01:23,780
He must be holding his breath inside.

32
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:31,370
So I have to keep an eye on him. Don’t worry.

33
00:01:31,850 --> 00:01:33,090
We will definitely protect our home
